@NotificationService_HostAddress = http://localhost:8086

### Health Check
GET {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Get Notifications for User
GET {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/notifications/user/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Accept: application/json

### Get Unread Count for User
GET {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/notifications/user/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/unread-count
Accept: application/json

### Mark All as Read for User
PUT {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/notifications/user/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/read-all
Accept: application/json

### Mark Single Notification as Read
PUT {{NotificationService_HostAddress}}/api/v1/notifications/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/read
Accept: application/json
